From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:09:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] drm/panel: nv3051d: add GA36 panel

Add the 640x480 panel of the GameConsole R36S GA36-MB board. It uses
two DSI lanes with EoT packets, its own vendor init sequence and a
30 MHz mode (55.7 Hz) taken from the vendor timings.

Signed-off-by: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
---
 .../gpu/drm/panel/panel-newvision-nv3051d.c   | 188 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 188 insertions(+)

